# Backend functions

All Cloud Functions live in `functions/src/` and are exported from `functions/src/index.ts`.

## Function inventory

| Export | Type | File |
|---|---|---|
| `getData` | HTTP | `getData.ts` |
| `update` | HTTP | `update.ts` |
| `buy` | HTTP | `buy.ts` |
| `sell` | HTTP | `sell.ts` |
| `scheduleBuy` | Scheduler (Mon 10:00 ET) | `buy.ts` |
| `scheduleSell` | Scheduler (Fri 15:50 ET) | `sell.ts` |

Use `export const` for all exports in `index.ts`.

## Config and secrets

- All env vars are loaded in `functions/src/config.ts` via `dotenv`
- Required: `OPENAI_API_KEY`, `ALPACA_API_KEY`, `ALPACA_SECRET_KEY`, `FB_API_KEY`, `FB_DB_URL`
- See `functions/.env.example` for the template
- Alpaca is paper-only (`paper: true`) — do not change without explicit request

## Data layer

- Firebase **Realtime Database** (not Firestore) — `firebase/database` in `config.ts`
- `UpdateProfile` in `update.ts` writes `account/` and `timeline/` nodes
- `getData.ts` reads the root and may trigger a refresh when data is stale

## Local dev

```bash
npm --prefix functions run serve
```

Emulator base URL: `http://127.0.0.1:5001/algosus/us-central1/`

## Lint

ESLint runs only in `functions/` (`npm --prefix functions run lint`). No root-level linter.
